    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Apocalypse in Style!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world ravaged by a revolutionary supplement turned plague, survivors must fight against mutated creatures known as the &quot;Addicted.&quot; This top-down survival shooter combines frantic action with strategic gameplay, challenging you to face increasingly intense dangers.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Heroes:</strong> Choose from a variety of characters, each with exclusive abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons and Upgrades:</strong> Discover and enhance weapons to tackle ever-evolving challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Bosses:</strong> Confront formidable foes with unique attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bunker:</strong> Unlock new content and customizations by exploring the bunker and completing missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics:</strong>\u00a0Inspired by 1950s cartoons with a modern twist.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world filled with action, mystery, and strategy. Are you ready to face your fears and leave your mark? The fight for survival starts now!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Apocalypse in Style!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world ravaged by a revolutionary supplement turned plague, survivors must fight against mutated creatures known as the &quot;Addicted.&quot; This top-down survival shooter combines frantic action with strategic gameplay, challenging you to face increasingly intense dangers.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Heroes:</strong> Choose from a variety of characters, each with exclusive abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons and Upgrades:</strong> Discover and enhance weapons to tackle ever-evolving challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Bosses:</strong> Confront formidable foes with unique attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bunker:</strong> Unlock new content and customizations by exploring the bunker and completing missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics:</strong>\u00a0Inspired by 1950s cartoons with a modern twist.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world filled with action, mystery, and strategy. Are you ready to face your fears and leave your mark? The fight for survival starts now!</p>",
